1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:54,679 --> 00:00:55,759
Where's Yutang?

17
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:57,359
He Jingchen, what did you do to her?

18
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:58,520
Where's Yutang?

19
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,399
Take him away.

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,240
=Episode 22=

21
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,640
He Jingchen!

22
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:24,879
You jerk!

23
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:26,799
You heartless scum!

24
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:29,799
I can't believe I misjudged you.

25
00:01:30,159 --> 00:01:31,519
Just try laying a hand on me.

26
00:01:32,079 --> 00:01:34,040
The Lu Army will never spare you.

27
00:01:34,140 --> 00:01:34,600
Oh.

28
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,359
I forgot to tell you.

29
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,879
The Lu Army won't be called that
much longer.

30
00:01:40,359 --> 00:01:43,079
I'm renaming it the Fancheng Army.

31
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,920
Good day, Ms. Lu.

32
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:51,079
But Ms. Lu will still be Ms. Lu.

33
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,480
You're in this together.

34
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,640
Father.

35
00:01:56,519 --> 00:01:57,959
The first time I went to the camp,

36
00:01:57,959 --> 00:02:00,680
I saw what an incredible shot you were.

37
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:02,480
I truly admired you.

38
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:05,319
That's why
I've practiced my shooting so hard.

39
00:02:05,519 --> 00:02:07,040
I wanted to be just like you.

40
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:11,120
Don't you enjoy these blind hunts?

41
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,680
I want to try it too.

42
00:02:14,319 --> 00:02:15,240
What are you doing?

43
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:17,039
Yutang, you can't do this!

44
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,039
You can't do this!

45
00:02:18,039 --> 00:02:19,120
I saved your life!

46
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:19,960
Yutang!

47
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:20,960
Yutang!

48
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:22,719
What are you doing?

49
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,080
Nice shot.

50
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:44,520
Lu Zhentian, you're still useful.

51
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,960
So I'll let you live for now.

52
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,240
Pack up.

53
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,319
Ms. Lu is going home.

54
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,360
(What do we do now?)

55
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,919
(Why aren't they back yet?)

56
00:02:58,039 --> 00:02:59,039
The governor is back!

57
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:00,080
Ms. Lu is back!

58
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,360
Commander He is back!

59
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:08,960
(What happened to the governor?)

60
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:12,840
(Wasn't he fine before?)

61
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:18,080
Back then, the governor
was seeing Ms. Lu off for her wedding

62
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,439
when bandits abducted them.

63
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:23,000
Thanks to Commander He and Ms. Lu,
who outsmarted the enemy

64
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,439
and coordinated with us from within,

65
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:27,039
we rescued the governor.

66
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,680
The governor was badly frightened

67
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,039
and suffered a stroke.

68
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:33,199
Fortunately, he survived.

69
00:03:33,199 --> 00:03:35,120
A family cannot go a day without a head,

70
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,800
nor an army without a commander.

71
00:03:36,919 --> 00:03:39,800
Now Commander He and Ms. Lu are back,

72
00:03:40,199 --> 00:03:42,080
we finally have people to lead us.

73
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,199
Staff Officer Chen.

74
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:47,639
Since all the Lu clan elders are here,

75
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,400
please tell them

76
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:51,719
what happened that day.

77
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:56,039
This bandit attack wasn't spontaneous.

78
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,240
It had been carefully planned
for a long time.

79
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,199
They split into two groups.

80
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:03,120
One group set up an ambush
on the road to Lancheng.

81
00:04:03,639 --> 00:04:04,439
The other took advantage of

82
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:07,319
the Governor's Residence's weakness
and launched a surprise attack.

83
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:11,599
These traitors secretly colluded

84
00:04:11,919 --> 00:04:14,000
with the bandits and helped them
enter the inner residence.

85
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:17,000
We were outnumbered
and couldn't fight them off,

86
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,639
so I went to the army for help.

87
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:20,759
When I returned with troops,

88
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:23,680
the Governor's Residence
had been mostly looted,

89
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:25,720
with heavy casualties.

90
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:30,199
We were held captive by bandits
in the mountains for days.

91
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:31,399
During that time,

92
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:34,240
I found a way to send word out

93
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,360
and contact Staff Officer Chen.

94
00:04:36,519 --> 00:04:38,240
We held out until he brought help.

95
00:04:38,639 --> 00:04:39,800
Unfortunately,

96
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:42,439
the governor couldn't withstand
the bandits' threats

97
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:44,839
and suffered a stroke.

98
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:46,759
No need to be so modest.

99
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:49,120
If not for your courage
and quick thinking,

100
00:04:49,319 --> 00:04:52,000
signaling me to draw the bandits away,

101
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,879
then teaming up with Ms. Lu

102
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:55,399
to coordinated with us from within,

103
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,160
and putting on an act for the bandits,

104
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:00,160
you wouldn't even have

105
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:02,360
a governor to see today.

106
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:04,519
Staff Officer Chen is right.

107
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,680
A family cannot go a day without a head.

108
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,360
Given the situation,

109
00:05:08,399 --> 00:05:12,800
we should quickly choose someone
capable and worthy

110
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:14,639
to take charge of
the Governor's Residence

111
00:05:14,639 --> 00:05:17,519
and serve as President
of the Lu Chamber of Commerce.

112
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:21,920
Until now, the Lu family, the Chamber,

113
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,120
and even the army

114
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:25,560
all followed the governor's lead.

115
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:29,600
The Chamber financed the Lu Army,

116
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:32,560
and the Lu Army protected the Chamber.

117
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:35,079
They supported each other.

118
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:38,279
That's how our clan came to control

119
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:41,439
Fancheng and keep the city secure.

120
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:46,720
Now, where can we find anyone
as capable as the governor?

121
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:49,439
Then divide and rule.

122
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,240
As long as the Chamber President

123
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:56,680
and Lu Army commander are both Lus

124
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,959
and work together,

125
00:05:58,959 --> 00:05:59,879
what difference would it make?

126
00:06:01,439 --> 00:06:03,319
This elder makes a good point.

127
00:06:04,079 --> 00:06:06,079
What matters is
that both are members of the Lu family.

128
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:10,279
I suggest you hear from Ms. Lu,

129
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:12,920
the true-blooded member
of the Lu family.

130
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,000
To be honest,

131
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,519
with all our clan elders here,

132
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:26,480
and officers like Commander He

133
00:06:26,839 --> 00:06:28,759
and Staff Officer Chen loyal to Father,

134
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:32,439
mere bandits are nothing to fear.

135
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,079
I only hate

136
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:36,759
how cruel Heaven has been.

137
00:06:38,199 --> 00:06:40,000
Father and I had only just reunited,

138
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:42,160
yet tragedy struck us so soon.

139
00:06:43,319 --> 00:06:45,839
It denied me the chance
to fulfill my duty as a daughter.

140
00:06:47,279 --> 00:06:48,360
Still,

141
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,800
thankfully, Father survived.

142
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,959
From now on,

143
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:52,240
I have only one wish:

144
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:55,160
to stay by Father's side

145
00:06:55,519 --> 00:06:56,439
and take good care of him.

146
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:02,040
Your devotion is admirable, Ms. Lu.

147
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,399
Even the governor is moved.

148
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,079
Sadly,

149
00:07:07,439 --> 00:07:09,639
he can no longer speak.

150
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:13,319
If he could,

151
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:14,920
I'm sure

152
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,720
he'd want his own flesh and blood

153
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,160
to inherit the Lu family fortune.

154
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,240
Commander He.

155
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,600
You must be joking.

156
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,199
Ms. Lu is just a woman.

157
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:31,160
How can she lead the Lu Chamber
and make it prosper?

158
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,399
Those aren't my words.

159
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,920
The governor said so himself
before his stroke.

160
00:07:36,439 --> 00:07:37,600
The governor said so himself?

161
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,879
What proof do you have?

162
00:07:40,079 --> 00:07:41,160
The proof is

163
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:43,959
Father gave me the Lu family heirloom.

164
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,720
To prove I'm telling the truth,

165
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:52,000
I brought back part of the treasure.

166
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:56,519
I'm sure you know how to verify it.

167
00:08:04,199 --> 00:08:05,000
That's right.

168
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,560
These are indeed our family's gold bars.

169
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,519
Under the Lu family's rules,

170
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:14,759
whoever the clan head tells
where the treasure is hidden

171
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:19,160
is the chosen heir to the Lu estate.

172
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,639
There's nothing more to discuss.

173
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:22,639
No.

174
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:25,040
Ms. Lu is just a woman.

175
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:27,240
How can she lead men in business?

176
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,920
How would you know

177
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,560
unless you let me try?

178
00:08:33,879 --> 00:08:36,360
Ms. Lu faced death with the governor

179
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:39,799
helped Commander He
save the governor's life.

180
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,120
For that alone,

181
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:42,559
even if she can't do it yet,

182
00:08:42,879 --> 00:08:44,960
we should give her our full support,

183
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,919
not question her.

184
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:46,799
Absolutely not.

185
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:51,600
The Lu Chamber of Commerce
must never go to a woman.

186
00:08:51,879 --> 00:08:54,000
In the crisis, the governor entrusted
Ms. Lu to me.

187
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:57,559
He told me to do everything I could

188
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:59,840
to help her inherit the estate,

189
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:04,480
knowing some of you would object.

190
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,600
Do you think
you're the only one with troops?

191
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,879
You're not the only commander
in the army.

192
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,480
Commanders Yang and Qin are there too.

193
00:09:12,039 --> 00:09:14,000
They're the governor's distant nephews.

194
00:09:14,759 --> 00:09:17,879
I propose choosing one of them

195
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:20,440
as Chamber President

196
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:22,559
and commander of the Lu Army.

197
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:28,399
You just mentioned
Commanders Yang and Qin.

198
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:31,120
There's something I should say.

199
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:35,519
That day, when Commander He
escorted Ms. Lu to her wedding,

200
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:39,639
I went to those two for help.

201
00:09:39,639 --> 00:09:43,080
Not only did they refuse to send troops,

202
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:45,000
- They said I was lying.
- What?

203
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:49,879
They believed the bandits came prepared.

204
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,799
If anything happened to the governor,

205
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:55,279
they could rebel and seize power.

206
00:09:55,799 --> 00:09:59,000
Now that you've brought them up,

207
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:00,960
could it be that afterward

208
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:03,840
you planned to join their rebellion?

209
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,360
No, no!

210
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,399
I swear I knew nothing about it!

211
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,639
Don't slander me!

212
00:10:06,879 --> 00:10:07,759
In any case,

213
00:10:07,759 --> 00:10:09,639
a woman can't command the Lu Army.

214
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:10,559
Exactly.

215
00:10:10,559 --> 00:10:11,200
Even the Chamber

216
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,480
can't go to a woman.

217
00:10:12,639 --> 00:10:13,360
(Exactly.)

218
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,720
(They'll say the Lus have no one left.)

219
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:15,360
Zhaolin.

220
00:10:15,919 --> 00:10:16,799
(This is outrageous.)

221
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:24,480
By now,

222
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:28,360
Commander Yang and Qin
are likely prisoners.

223
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,279
I think

224
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:34,200
the Lu Army already belongs
to Commander He now.

225
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,519
We...

226
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:39,159
should know when to yield.

227
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:44,600
We fully support Ms. Lu
inheriting the family estate.

228
00:10:44,879 --> 00:10:48,279
We fully support Commander He
purging the army of traitors.

229
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:52,960
We ask Ms. Lu to serve
as Chamber President.

230
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,200
Effective immediately.

231
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:58,240
We ask Ms. Lu to serve
as Chamber President.

232
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,799
Effective immediately.

233
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:08,200
What happened to Young Master Rong?

234
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,440
It's nothing serious.

235
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,399
He was just frightened

236
00:11:11,399 --> 00:11:12,519
and fainted.

237
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,720
Don't worry, Great-Uncle.

238
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:17,320
Rong Muxian has been pampered
by Rong Yunhai since childhood.

239
00:11:17,519 --> 00:11:18,759
I doubt he's ever

240
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,600
faced anything like this before.

241
00:11:22,279 --> 00:11:24,039
A sheltered young master like him

242
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:26,559
is hardly a good match for Ms. Lu.

243
00:11:28,039 --> 00:11:29,759
Ms. Lu, your loyalty is admirable.

244
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:30,960
You have my respect.

245
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,200
Rest assured, Ms. Lu.

246
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,600
As long as I'm here,

247
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:38,080
none of the younger men in the clan
will dare make trouble.

248
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,799
I'll go at once

249
00:11:40,799 --> 00:11:43,200
to have your gold seal prepared.

250
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,360
Get some rest, Ms. Lu.

251
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,600
Don't be in such a hurry.

252
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:04,120
Once you've served your final purpose,

253
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:07,039
I'll send you to the deepest hell.

254
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:17,519
Ms...

255
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,399
Ms. Lu.

256
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:27,279
Lady Que, you were
the last woman Father loved

257
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:29,679
before his stroke.

258
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:33,879
From today on,
you'll attend to Father's daily needs.

259
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,399
Any objections, Lady Que?

260
00:12:38,519 --> 00:12:39,159
No.

261
00:12:39,159 --> 00:12:40,279
I'll do as you say, Ms. Lu.

262
00:13:16,279 --> 00:13:18,559
You useless old fool.

263
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:41,800
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

264
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:46,440
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

265
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:49,600
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

266
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,120
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

267
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:56,480
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

268
00:13:57,120 --> 00:14:02,440
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

269
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:07,160
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

270
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:10,640
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

271
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,960
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

272
00:14:13,280 --> 00:14:16,200
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

273
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:22,880
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

274
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:26,480
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

275
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:29,680
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

276
